{"metadata":{"title":"Tracker","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L51","fileName":"Tracker.swift"},"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"role":"symbol"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Structures","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/Records-swift.struct"],"title":"Structures"},{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/enriched(by:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"],"title":"Instance Methods"},{"anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"],"title":"Type Properties"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker is a value. Build one where the app starts, start delivering its records, and either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass the tracker down or bind it to a task with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTracker"},{"text":" and read it anywhere inside with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current","type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: ConsoleDestination())","withTracker(tracker) {","    Tracker.current.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Copies share one stream of records. A binding reaches the work run inside ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTracker"},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the child tasks it starts, but not callbacks a framework runs on tasks of its own, such as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"UI framework’s button actions: pass those a tracker.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" does nothing but accept the event, from any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"thread: it reads the clock, captures the call site and the task’s "},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and queues"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them. A worker the tracker owns, which never runs on the main actor, does everything else, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the order events were tracked: the constraints’ check, the enrichers, the samplers, the consent,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a store’s writes, and publishing to "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". No API runs that work on a caller’s thread. "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" waits for the worker to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"catch up; "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" does too, then ends the records."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tracked events wait in memory, without a bound, until the worker reaches them. The queue"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t be bounded without losing something it mustn’t: it also carries consent decisions and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the waits of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"track"},{"type":"text","text":" can’t wait for room without blocking its caller."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Without a store, records live in memory only, and records not yet delivered are lost if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"process exits. A tracker given a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RecordStore"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivers what the store kept from earlier runs first, and writes each record to it once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"worker reaches it: a record is durable from then on, and one tracked moments before the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"process is killed, not yet reached, is lost.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker given "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s keeps a seeded fraction of the events they apply to, dropping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest before they are held, written or delivered and reporting them on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker given a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" delivers an event only once its category is granted, holding it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while undecided and dropping it when denied; one given none delivers every event.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property","abstract":[{"text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a delivery to read.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"records"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","text":"Tracker"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV7RecordsV","text":"Records"}],"title":"records","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/samplingDropReports":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports","title":"samplingDropReports","abstract":[{"text":"A report of each event the tracker’s ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","type":"reference"},{"text":"s dropped, in the order the drops happen.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samplingDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV","text":"SamplingDropReport"},{"kind":"text",